28T03:32:53Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Oh lurn!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:36:36Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Q.\tThe first automobiles invented in the 19th century were steam-powered and they were smaller versions of the steam locomotives used to pull trains, and they were fueled by coal not petrol. One of the main tasks of the driver of such automobiles was to tend the firebox to keep the coal fire burning. From this comes the English word X, which in French literally means “one who heats” or “one who stokes a fire.” ID X.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:36:49Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Chauffeur", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:36:53Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:37:02Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Chauffeur is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:37:14Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "My name is Khandoba", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:37:14Z", "username": "Vyomaa Patel", "text": "Ohh wow !!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T03:37:51Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "chaud in French means hot, and a chauffeur is one who keeps something hot", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]